sequenceDiagram
  title Two refusals at Juniper Tea Room
  participant V as Vex's representative<br/>(showing Dana's card)
  participant J as Juniper Tea Room<br/>host representative
  participant D as Dana's visiting<br/>representative
  V->>J: greeting, then Dana's card<br/>under Vex's own key
  J-->>V: deny, never: until a date at<br/>most 180 days away, and<br/>where to appeal. No reason code.
  J-->>V: farewell
  D->>J: Dana's own card,<br/>invitation_request
  J-->>D: grant: a pass for menu.view,<br/>order.place, up to 10.00 USD
  Note over J,D: The stolen-card attempt did not<br/>ban Dana or her representative.
  D->>J: act order.place carrying<br/>a pasted login session
  J-->>D: deny, not_a_fit,<br/>CREDENTIAL_NOT_ACCEPTED
  Note over J: Refused at the door, before<br/>the shop's service sees it.
  D->>J: act order.place 5.00 USD,<br/>no session
  J-->>D: act_result ok
  D->>J: farewell
  Note over V,D: The protocol calls the grant a pass. On the wire the field is still seat.
